    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446-a1">

                <pb facs="0616" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg520"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 21.—Translation.—Telegrams sent
                        in Turkish.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bagdasarian to United States Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Salmas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="hijri gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-09"><hi rendition="#italic">17th of Zeekadeh, 1315</hi>
                                (<hi rendition="#italic">9th of April, 1898</hi>)</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <p>By order of the Emir-i-Nizam, I am kept as a prisoner. I beg you to obtain my
                    release.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
